+Base: `2874963d` (`ms178/lccc` main, post-#583).
+Environment: harness-wiped sandbox fully re-bootstrapped (8 GiB swap, rustup
+stable 1.98.1, kernel tree regenerated by `prepare_kernel_tree.sh`, 28/28
