+## 11. The competing revision: what landed upstream and the verdict
+
+Upstream main advanced past this document's base by two co-authored commits
+that attack the same boot-size territory from the analysis side:
+
+* **`654995ce`** — x86-64 SSE call-argument staging liveness hardening
+  (`# LCCC_CALL_FP <n>` authority marker, register-class-only hazard
+  pre-spills, hardened fallback window walk) + float add/sub-of-negation
+  folds in `simplify_binop`.
+* **`d0bf7d01`** — i686 `fold_copy_narrow_ext_pairs` (`movl %S,%D` +
+  `mov{z,s}X{l,w} %D<narrow>,%D` -> one extension of `%S`), the
+  `CCC_NO_I686_ACCUM_NOHOME` measured switch, paired A/B and instruction
+  census harnesses (`boot_ab_size.py`, `boot_insn_census.py`).
+
+**Where I agree, and kept the work:**
+
+* The paired A/B methodology (`boot_ab_size.py`) is *better* than a
+  reference-only oracle: deltas attribute to codegen, absolute gaps do not.
+  This session's headline decomposition was produced with it.
+* The accum no-home investigation is exemplary negative-result engineering:
+  the theory said lift the policy, the corpus said +391 B WORSE, the policy
+  stayed, and the measurement is preserved behind a switch.  That is the
+  house doctrine executed correctly.
+* `fold_copy_narrow_ext_pairs` itself is soundly built: fail-closed rules
+  each with a named wrong-code shape (%ah/%al alias, %esp, missing
+  subregisters, barriers), and — born from a real shipping defect
+  (`movzwl%bx`, missing space) — a test that routes the fused text through
+  the actual assembler.  Kept, now with the bisection switch it was missing
+  (`CCC_NO_COPY_NARROW_EXT_FOLD`; the house rule is that every peephole
+  family is individually measurable — their own commit message argues this
+  for accum-nohome, and the pass deserved the same).
+* The `# LCCC_CALL_FP` authority marker is the right architectural
+  direction (emit-side authority over analysis-side guessing), and the
+  mnemonic-level transparent-line skip (`pushq`/`popq` regardless of
+  operand) composes with this session's new push spellings — verified.
+* The add/sub-of-negation folds are IEEE-exact (negate is a sign-bit
+  operation; the ABI defines subtract(x, y) as add(x, negate(y)) with no
+  double rounding), and the qNaN-sign adjudication (take the latitude the
+  oracles take, for bit-parity) is the correct call.
+
+**Where I disagree, with data:**
+
+1. **The strategic scope miss.** Their census diagnosed the disease
+   correctly — "546 slot stores vs 41" is exactly the homing-copy surplus —
+   and then treated a 2-byte-per-site fold (−104 B boot) while the
+   structural cure (param direct homing + push staging, this document's
