+
+   | lever (boot corpus, paired A/B)            | delta |
+   |--------------------------------------------|-------|
+   | this session's tree, direct homing OFF     | +89 B |
+   | this session's tree, push staging OFF      | +297 B|
+   | this session's tree, copy+narrow-ext fold OFF | **±0 B** |
+
+   The fold's boot win **evaporates** once direct homing exists: the
+   `movl %S,%D` copies it fuses were largely homing artifacts.  The
