+`target/`, or the full kernel tree (`arch/x86/boot` came back with ONE
+file).  Anything derived — clones, builds, prepared trees — is
+re-derivable by design; the ledger + patch + tar + bundle survived and
+drove the whole reconstruction.  The 10k-file snapshot cap is why oracle
+SOURCES were never allowed into the persisted tree (binaries only, §7).
